      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fox%2C_Montana",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Finnish immigrant miners settled in Fox, and by 1920 their children still spoke Finnish at home.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
